# Germination Practicum: "Put two +1/+1 counters on each creature you control." Both of Bot1's creatures - Llanowar Elves and
# an Ornithopter (an artifact creature) - get two counters; an opponent's Ornithopter and Bot1's own Mox Jet (an artifact
# that is not a creature) get none. Cast on turn 3 with a Black Lotus and two Forests.

